@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade DevOps - Backend Build, Test, and Package Flow

component "mvn -B clean verify" as Maven EZ_DEVOPS
component "clean\nremoves target" as Clean
component "compile\nJava release 21" as Compile
component "test-compile" as TestCompile
component "test\nJUnit/Mockito/Spring tests" as Test
component "verify\nlifecycle verification" as Verify
component "spring-boot-maven-plugin" as BootPlugin
component "spring-modulith-starter-test\nApplicationModules.verify()" as ModulithTest
component "Controller/service/domain/security/cache tests" as TestSuite

Maven --> Clean
Clean --> Compile
Compile --> TestCompile
TestCompile --> Test
Test --> TestSuite
Test --> ModulithTest
Test --> Verify
Verify --> BootPlugin : plugin available in the build

note right of Compile
pom.xml declares java.version=23,
but maven-compiler-plugin uses release=21.
CI installs JDK 23.
end note

note bottom
Evidence: backend/pom.xml, backend/src/test/java, and the GitHub Actions workflow.
No Maven phase for Docker image build or deployment is configured in CI.
end note

@enduml
